      "title": "File:Münster, Prinzipalmarkt -- 2014 -- 6858.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2a/M%C3%BCnster%2C_Prinzipalmarkt_--_2014_--_6858.jpg",
